# Backend manzili. Global prefiks (`/api/v1`) MANZILNING ICHIDA bo'ladi —
# kod uni o'zi qo'shmaydi. Rasm yo'llari (`/uploads/...`) shu manzilning
# domen qismidan olinadi (`API_ORIGIN`, src/shared/api/config.js).
#
#   dev        : http://localhost:3000/api/v1   (api/ paketida `pnpm start:dev`)
#   production : https://api.vodiykafel.uz/api/v1
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/v1

# Optom mijoz kabineti (dashboard/) manzili — storefront'dagi «Optom kirish»
# tugmasi shu yerga olib boradi (S-045). Bu yerda login formasi YO'Q (G1).
VITE_CABINET_URL=http://localhost:5174
